        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "The collection's organic forms are inspired by the furniture-making process and the forms found in a workshop. Each piece is crafted with care and attention to detail, with every knot and imperfection in the wood adding to the beauty and authenticity of the design."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image-classic",
          "image": "/images/origin-collection/Lotus-Bed.jpg",
